<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">Ref No: {{{Case.Case_Number__c}}}<br />
<br />
Hi&nbsp;{{{Case.First_Name__c}}},
<p>Thank you for contacting the Qantas Customer Care team about our flight schedule.<br />
<br />
<em><strong>If cancelled route use:-</strong></em><br />
<br />
I understand your disappointment that we’re no longer flying to {{{Case.Arrival_Airport__c}}}. We’re constantly looking at the flights we offer to ensure they remain commercially viable.<br />
<br />
However, in today’s competitive environment, it’s not feasible to operate services at a loss.<br />
<br />
<em><strong>If current schedule doesn’t meet needs, use</strong></em><br />
<br />
We’re always happy to add additional services to our timetable if we believe they will be commercially viable and are constantly monitoring the number of flights we operate on each of our routes.<br />
<br />
While we have no plans to increase our flight frequency between {{{Case.Departure_Airport__c}}}-{{{Case.Arrival_Airport__c}}} at the moment, I’ll make sure that your comments are passed on to our scheduling department for use in their next review of this route.<br />
<br />
<strong>We value your opinion</strong><br />
Customer feedback is extremely important to us so that we can provide you with exceptional service each time you fly with Qantas.<br />
<br />
We look forward to welcoming you again onboard soon.</p>
</body>
</html>